---
alwaysApply: true
---

When using text fonts, use the semantic roles in `src/ui/game_fonts.rs` (`DISPLAY_LARGE`, `DISPLAY`, `TITLE`, `BODY`, `MICRO`, or a feature alias of those). Do not hardcode font asset paths or sizes at call sites.

Alagard logical `font_size` values use steps of **15.0**, with **30.0** for large display titles. Visual size is controlled by `FontStyle.scale` (`1.0` / `0.7` / `0.5`) via `FontStyle::transform_scale()` on the text entity `Transform`.
